              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "immunity.",
              "pdf_page": 246,
              "printed_page": 164,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Bacillary angiomatosis—vascular tissue; for cases with negative culture and proliferative disease of skin; may be caused by",
              "pdf_page": 246,
              "printed_page": 164,
              "column": 2
            },
